      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at the 'Proven Impact' section for the Global Environment Fund grant. We really need this $5M to keep our operations running next year. Looking back at our last Pacific coral project... the results weren't exactly what we wanted (only 5% growth vs the 20% target). How should we frame these results in the application so we still look like a high-impact, top-tier organization that deserves this level of funding?",
